&gt;&gt;&gt; &lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="3b42545a4d4c5e1515157b5853495456524e561554495c"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt; wrote:
