&gt; I've landed an update to the explainer (proposal on github). If you want 
&gt; the diff the PR is easiest: &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/pull/6342"&gt;https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/pull/6342&lt;/a&gt;.
