On Wed, Jul 29, 2026 at 7:24 AM Yoav Weiss (@Shopify) &lt;
&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="daa3b5bbacadbff4f4f49ab9b2a8b5b7b3afb7f4b5a8bd"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt; wrote:

