&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div itemprop="articleBody" class="msgBody"&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;LGTM3

On Wed, Aug 5, 2026 at 8:08 AM Vladimir Levin &lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="86f0ebf6a8a8a8c6e5eef4e9ebeff3eba8e9f4e1"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt; wrote:&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre&gt;

&gt; LGTM2
&gt;
&gt; On Wednesday, August 5, 2026 at 10:39:31 AM UTC-4 Daniel Bratell wrote:
&gt;
&gt;&gt; LGTM1
&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; Stage 4 TC39 proposal already implemented elsewhere. Thanks for getting
&gt;&gt; it into Chromium.
&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; /Daniel
&gt;&gt; On 2026-08-05 14:40, Chromestatus wrote:
&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; *Contact emails*
&gt;&gt; &lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="95fbfcfefaf9bbbbbbd5f6fde7faf8fce0f8bbfae7f2"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="432c2f6d6d6d03242c2c242f266d202c2e"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;
&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; *Specification*
&gt;&gt; &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/tc39/proposal-joint-iteration"&gt;https://github.com/tc39/proposal-joint-iteration&lt;/a&gt;
&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; *Summary*
&gt;&gt; A TC39 proposal to synchronise the advancement of multiple iterators,
&gt;&gt; often called zip.
&gt;&gt;
