Motivation

WebHID API enables websites to connect to USB and Bluetooth devices that
use the Human Interface Device (HID) protocol. Launching the API on Android
enables web apps to unlock advanced functionality on user's devices and
build cross-platform experiences that are interoperable on desktop Chrome
and Android.


