&lt;pre&gt;LGTM3

On Wednesday, August 12, 2026 at 8:34:24 AM UTC-7 Rick Byers wrote:&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre&gt;

&gt; I assume there is good Test262 coverage? LGTM2 if so (but please add a 
&gt; test262 link to the chromestatus entry for the record)
&gt;
&gt; Rick
&gt;
&gt; On Wed, Aug 12, 2026 at 11:30 AM Vladimir Levin &lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="a3d5ced38d8d8de3c0cbd1cccecad6ce8dccd1c4"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt; 
&gt; wrote:
&gt;
&gt;&gt; LGTM1
&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; On Wednesday, August 12, 2026 at 2:39:59 AM UTC-4 Chromestatus wrote:
&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt;&gt; *Contact emails*
&gt;&gt;&gt; &lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="eb8487c5c5c5ab8c84848c878ec5888486"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;
