&gt;
&gt; *Requires code in //chrome?*
&gt; False
&gt;
&gt; *Tracking bug*
&gt; &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://issues.chromium.org/issues/40862777"&gt;https://issues.chromium.org/issues/40862777&lt;/a&gt;
&gt;
&gt; *Estimated milestones*
