&gt; LGTM2
&gt; On 7/29/26 4:27 p.m., Rick Byers wrote:
&gt;
&gt; We discussed this in API owners today and Alex made a compelling argument
&gt; for why there is no need to namespace-scope IWA APIs (they're already
&gt; heavily scoped by the fact they exist only in the niche IWA operating
&gt; environment). Alex, Reilly, Edman and I then met to discuss the tradeoffs
&gt; further and agreed that we'd remove the namespace scoping (eg.
&gt; window.setShape).
&gt;
&gt; Given this significant change, I suggest we reset the lgtm counter. I'm
&gt; LGTM1 with this new plan (once the spec is updated to reflect it).
&gt;
&gt; Thanks,
&gt;    Rick
