&gt;
&gt; On Thu, Jul 30, 2026, 11:31 AM Mike Taylor &lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="9df0f4f6f8e9fcb3b3b3ddfef5eff2f0f4e8f0b3f2effa"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt; wrote:
