Specification
&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://pr-preview.s3.amazonaws.com/xingri/gamepad/pull/196.html#gamepadbuttontype-enum"&gt;https://pr-preview.s3.amazonaws.com/xingri/gamepad/pull/196.html#gamepadbuttontype-enum&lt;/a&gt;


Summary
Gamepad API defines standard indices for 17 common gamepad buttons. The 
GamepadButton type attribute provides an alternate, interoperable identifier 
for common buttons that are not included in the standard set, like &quot;trackpad&quot;.


Blink component
Blink&gt;GamepadAPI


Web Feature ID
gamepad


Motivation
Gamepad API should provide an interoperable way to identify common buttons that 
are not included in the standard set of buttons, particularly the trackpad 
button that appears on PlayStation gamepads.


Initial public proposal
&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/w3c/gamepad/issues/191"&gt;https://github.com/w3c/gamepad/issues/191&lt;/a&gt;


Search tags
gamepad, button, trackpad


Goals for experimentation
None


Requires code in //chrome?
False


Tracking bug
