&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; *Summary*
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; WGSL language feature for reinterpreting data in variables. The feature 
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; allows developers to divide a single uniform, storage, or workgroup 
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; variable into multiple logical variables. It also allows the type of the 
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; data in the variable to be interpreted as multiple types within the 
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; program. 
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; *Blink component*
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; Blink&gt;WebGPU 
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://issues.chromium.org/issues?q=customfield1222907:%22Blink%3EWebGPU%22"&gt;https://issues.chromium.org/issues?q=customfield1222907:%22Blink%3EWebGPU%22&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
