*Specification* &lt;a rel="nofollow" href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#responsive-iframes"&gt;https://drafts.csswg.org/css-sizing-4/#responsive-iframes&lt;/a&gt;
*Summary* Allow sites to opt into iframes having responsive sizing (sizing the &lt;iframe&gt; element in the parent document to the iframe document's layout overflow sizing, so that scrolling in the child document is avoided).
