On Tuesday, April 28, 2026 at 11:23:38 AM UTC-7 &lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="f387869dddddddb3949c9c949f96dd909c9e"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt; wrote:&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre&gt;

