&lt;pre&gt; On Tuesday, April 28, 2026 at 8:01:05 PM UTC+2 &lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="d2b6b3bcfcfcfc92bfbbb1a0bda1bdb4a6fcb1bdbf"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt; wrote:&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre&gt;
